/Users/robin/Obsidian/Brain/Projects/Gold Rush/Landmark packs follow the source ladder and terrain-relative mounts — 2026-07-15-0130.md:10:The map-rebuild landmark wave resolves all 36 current mount ids across The Claim, Dry Gulch, Twin Banks, Night Shift, Baron, Hill Mine, and Trestle. Source selection is recorded per body and follows the ruled order: reuse an existing project GLB, derive from shipped paint and existing shapes, then build new only when the first two rungs cannot supply the type. The completed mix is 15 reuse, 9 derive, and 12 build-new.
